# L §5.16: cdf of a distribution value (not a fact): cdf(uniform(0, 4) to 0.001, 1) = 1/4, exact (table: uniform
# "exact"); its sample step plays no part.  L §7.3: cdf of normal needs to u (LOAD-TO without it, at load).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input one4: num
input four: num
def c: num = cdf(uniform(0, four) to 0.001, one4) at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  one4 = 1
  four = 4

ask a: c law 2026-06-30
=== expect
a: 0.25
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-12-31
